Prescription items
GET /api/prescription-items/{id} – get by ID
POST /api/prescription-items – create
PUT /api/prescription-items/{id} – update
GET /api/prescription-items/prescription/{prescriptionId} – items for prescription
GET /api/prescription-items/medicine/{medicineId} – items for medicine
