Running the application
Set up PostgreSQL with the database and credentials from application-dev.properties.
Run:
   mvn spring-boot:run
Or, with explicit profile:
   mvn spring-boot:run -Dspring-boot.run.profiles=dev
Default users: receptionist / receptpass, doctor / doctorpass, pharmacist / pharmacistpass